/**
 * {{name}} fixture tests (CLAUDE.md rule 5). Save a real, signed-out listing page as
 * __fixtures__/{{fixture}} first (see docs/sources/{{folder}}.md), then review the
 * snapshot this writes: it is the adapter's expected output.
